# Only what the image needs: the server and the port's frontend source. Everything
# else stays out, above all the game files (public/game), the extracted assets and
# fonts (port/assets) and the data (data/): they're mounted at run time, never baked in.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!server/
!scripts/backup-db.sh
!scripts/moderate.mjs
!scripts/grant-credits.mjs
!port/web/
port/web/node_modules/
port/web/dist/
